WEBVTT

00:01.918 --> 00:04.504
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:32.091 --> 01:33.343
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.426 --> 01:34.886
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:42.602 --> 01:43.520
Next!

01:48.691 --> 01:51.611
What’s with you? Are your legs injured?

02:01.329 --> 02:02.413
Lady Loulan.

02:06.918 --> 02:07.877
I see.

02:17.011 --> 02:18.930
What’s wrong, Xiaolan?

02:19.013 --> 02:22.183
Know any good job openings?

02:22.267 --> 02:23.601
Job openings?

02:23.685 --> 02:24.644
Yeah.

02:24.727 --> 02:27.647
In six months,
my service in the rear palace will be up.

02:28.606 --> 02:32.360
A palace woman from a wealthy family
might receive a marriage proposal,

02:32.443 --> 02:34.237
but that’s not the case for me.

02:34.946 --> 02:37.157
Maomao, got any connections?

02:37.949 --> 02:39.659
Connections, huh?

02:40.493 --> 02:44.122
<i>Back when we first met,</i>
<i>Xiaolan was always gossiping.</i>

02:44.205 --> 02:46.249
<i>But now, as part of the first class</i>
<i>at the learning hall,</i>

02:46.332 --> 02:47.959
<i>she’s dedicated to her studies.</i>

02:48.877 --> 02:52.422
<i>I hope she finds a good job</i>
<i>after leaving the rear palace.</i>

02:52.505 --> 02:55.008
If I had to recommend somewhere…

02:55.091 --> 02:55.925
You know a place?

02:56.551 --> 02:58.261
Well, I guess I do, but…

02:59.387 --> 03:02.140
<i>The Verdigris House</i>
<i>in the pleasure district</i>

03:02.223 --> 03:05.685
<i>welcomes young, charming,</i>
<i>and good-looking girls.</i>

03:05.768 --> 03:09.522
<i>Xiaolan still looks a bit youthful,</i>
<i>but her features aren’t bad.</i>

03:10.398 --> 03:13.443
<i>More importantly, her honest personality</i>
<i>makes her easy to train.</i>

03:13.526 --> 03:16.029
<i>Any experienced madam would want her.</i>

03:16.112 --> 03:20.617
<i>But working as a servant there</i>
<i>isn’t something you can suggest lightly.</i>

03:20.700 --> 03:24.996
My connection is really a last resort.
Only if there’s no other choice.

03:25.079 --> 03:27.457
Eh? What’s that supposed to mean?

03:27.540 --> 03:29.292
Do you have anyone else you can rely on?

03:30.710 --> 03:36.257
<i>No good. If I ask Lord Jinshi,</i>
<i>Xiaolan might get caught up in some mess.</i>

03:36.341 --> 03:37.592
-What’s going on?
-Oh!

03:38.509 --> 03:40.094
Oh! Shisui!

03:41.221 --> 03:44.182
Hey, do you know any good job openings?

03:44.265 --> 03:45.266
Why do you ask?

03:45.892 --> 03:51.564
My service is ending soon, so I'm
looking for a job. Got any connections?

03:51.648 --> 03:53.191
Well, I guess I could say I do.

03:53.274 --> 03:54.275
Really?

03:54.359 --> 03:57.528
Or rather, I could help you make one.

04:02.784 --> 04:03.785
The bathhouse?

04:04.994 --> 04:08.414
There aren’t many people here
at this time.

04:08.998 --> 04:13.378
<i>Bathhouses that use plenty of water</i>
<i>are exclusive to the wealthy.</i>

04:14.254 --> 04:17.131
<i>This one is large enough</i>
<i>to hold a thousand people at once,</i>

04:17.215 --> 04:21.135
<i>with a main bath</i>
<i>that can fit several hundred.</i>

04:25.181 --> 04:29.936
<i>High-ranking consorts have private baths</i>
<i>in their palaces.</i>

04:30.645 --> 04:32.730
<i>This building has</i>

04:32.814 --> 04:36.067
<i>small baths for mid-ranking consorts</i>

04:36.693 --> 04:39.070
<i>and a large communal bath</i>
<i>for the palace maids.</i>

04:40.071 --> 04:43.950
<i>I used the bath at the Verdigris House</i>
<i>as if it were normal,</i>

04:44.033 --> 04:46.577
<i>but commoners usually just</i>
<i>wipe themselves down with water.</i>

04:47.578 --> 04:51.082
<i>Just being able to bathe at all</i>
<i>is a privilege for palace maids.</i>

04:51.749 --> 04:53.042
Shisui!

04:54.168 --> 04:56.546
Hot! Too hot!

04:59.382 --> 05:00.675
Come on,

05:00.758 --> 05:03.803
you know that early baths are always hot.

05:03.886 --> 05:07.682
They gradually cool down
to the perfect temperature.

05:09.183 --> 05:12.270
I usually bathe later, so I didn’t know.

05:12.854 --> 05:13.688
<i>Oh…</i>

05:14.397 --> 05:15.732
What? Maomao?

05:16.399 --> 05:17.483
Well…

05:17.567 --> 05:21.404
I just noticed that
you actually look slimmer in clothes.

05:21.988 --> 05:23.948
Where are you looking?

05:24.032 --> 05:24.949
It’s a habit.

05:25.867 --> 05:28.077
Hey Shisui, that's not okay.

05:28.161 --> 05:30.538
You have to wash yourself properly
before getting in the bath.

05:43.259 --> 05:45.470
Maomao, can I have some of that too?

05:45.553 --> 05:46.971
Go ahead.

05:50.975 --> 05:53.644
-What is that?
-A medical office hair-washing agent.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.855
Want to try it, Xiaolan?

05:55.938 --> 05:56.773
Yeah!

06:03.821 --> 06:06.449
Wah! It stings my eyes!

06:06.532 --> 06:08.117
Close your eyes.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.668
<i>She’s like a puppy.</i>

06:32.517 --> 06:34.852
This area isn’t too hot.

06:34.936 --> 06:37.563
I think I’ll just stick to
wiping myself down with water.

06:37.647 --> 06:40.066
Really? It feels nice.

06:41.818 --> 06:45.613
<i>Xiaolan grew up in a farming village,</i>
<i>so she’s not used to soaking in hot water.</i>

06:46.531 --> 06:48.825
<i>Wiping down probably feels better for her.</i>

06:49.742 --> 06:51.911
So, Shisui,
about that connection you mentioned…

06:53.246 --> 06:54.622
Right!

06:59.710 --> 07:01.629
This way, this way.

07:01.712 --> 07:05.174
No, we can’t!
This area is for consorts only!

07:05.800 --> 07:07.135
Can we really go in?

07:07.802 --> 07:09.345
It’s fine!

07:09.428 --> 07:12.890
We’re allowed, plus the connection
I mentioned is just ahead.

07:18.438 --> 07:19.439
I see now.

07:24.527 --> 07:26.028
Excuse us.

07:26.112 --> 07:28.322
Oh? A new girl?

07:28.406 --> 07:31.075
Yes! Looking forward to working with you.

07:34.912 --> 07:35.955
Here, this is fragrant oil.

07:36.038 --> 07:38.332
Please apply more pressure.

07:38.416 --> 07:40.168
Understood.

07:40.251 --> 07:42.128
Here, you two help too.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.088
Xiaolan, take this.

07:47.216 --> 07:48.968
Alright, excuse me then.

07:50.178 --> 07:52.346
A little more to the right.

07:52.430 --> 07:56.476
<i>This consort probably</i>
<i>hasn’t been favored by the Emperor.</i>

07:56.559 --> 07:59.479
<i>If she had, she’d be wary of</i>
<i>letting an unfamiliar maid</i>

07:59.562 --> 08:02.356
<i>touch her like this, in case of sabotage.</i>

08:10.615 --> 08:13.326
<i>I’ve seen enough women</i>
<i>at the pleasure district</i>

08:13.409 --> 08:15.411
<i>to notice these things.</i>

08:19.499 --> 08:20.708
I’m back.

08:21.667 --> 08:22.752
What’s that?

08:24.253 --> 08:25.213
Thread.

08:25.880 --> 08:27.590
What for?

08:28.382 --> 08:31.802
You use it like this to remove hair,
by catching it in the thread.

08:33.262 --> 08:34.597
Would you like to try it?

08:38.643 --> 08:40.520
Does it hurt?

08:40.603 --> 08:44.190
It’s pretty painful,
but better than a dull razor.

08:45.149 --> 08:47.485
I’ll finish it by applying fragrant oil
to smooth the skin.

08:50.238 --> 08:52.031
I’ll see how it goes for now.

08:52.114 --> 08:53.366
When will you be back?

08:53.950 --> 08:55.618
When would you like?

08:55.701 --> 08:57.411
Maybe the day after tomorrow?

09:00.748 --> 09:05.628
<i>I see. So this is how she gets close to</i>
<i>consorts she wouldn’t normally meet.</i>

09:06.420 --> 09:09.048
<i>This must be the "connection"</i>
<i>Shisui was talking about.</i>

09:12.176 --> 09:15.513
Massaging is surprisingly tiring.

09:15.596 --> 09:17.890
Yeah, a whole line formed
after you started.

09:18.683 --> 09:20.518
The maid who used to do it

09:20.601 --> 09:23.229
finished her contract and left.

09:23.312 --> 09:26.065
You sure know a lot, Shisui.

09:26.691 --> 09:30.152
That maid was favored
by one of the consorts

09:30.236 --> 09:33.573
and now works for her family.

09:33.656 --> 09:37.618
Oh! So that can happen too!

09:37.702 --> 09:38.578
Sometimes,

09:39.161 --> 09:42.415
they even give us things they don’t
use anymore, like combs and necklaces.

09:42.498 --> 09:44.166
Wow!

09:44.250 --> 09:47.587
Even if it’s broken, if the material
is good, it can fetch a high price.

09:48.170 --> 09:50.339
<i>Shisui sure is sharp.</i>

09:51.215 --> 09:54.093
<i>But maids can only use the bathhouse</i>
<i>every other day.</i>

09:54.719 --> 09:58.222
<i>If we start hanging around longer</i>
<i>just to massage consorts,</i>

09:58.306 --> 10:01.392
<i>what will Hongniang say?</i>

10:01.475 --> 10:03.978
Alright! Time to find myself a connection!

10:04.061 --> 10:05.146
Yeah!

10:09.942 --> 10:12.528
Oh, massages in the bathhouse?

10:12.612 --> 10:15.323
Yes, I was accompanying
an acquaintance who works there.

10:17.658 --> 10:21.329
Yeah, I know it’s not allowed. Understood.

10:22.163 --> 10:24.624
But isn’t it fine, Hongniang?

10:24.707 --> 10:25.916
Lady Gyokuyou!

10:26.000 --> 10:27.793
In places like that, people relax

10:27.877 --> 10:29.795
and unexpected conversations slip out.

10:30.504 --> 10:32.381
Gossip from the palace, for example.

10:33.090 --> 10:36.886
Maomao, if you hear any interesting
stories, do share them with me.

10:38.304 --> 10:39.347
You heard her!

10:39.430 --> 10:42.141
<i>As expected of Lady Gyokuyou…</i>

10:42.224 --> 10:44.477
<i>She's just as sharp as Shisui.</i>

10:46.646 --> 10:50.608
<i>True, there’s a lot of talk</i>
<i>floating around here.</i>

10:51.901 --> 10:55.529
<i>Rumors about Lady Gyokuyou’s pregnancy</i>
<i>had already spread.</i>

10:56.113 --> 10:57.657
<i>They were even</i>

10:57.740 --> 11:00.868
<i>speculating about the baby's gender</i>
<i>and the due date.</i>

11:01.702 --> 11:06.082
<i>Lately, whispers about Lady Lihua being</i>
<i>pregnant were also beginning to circulate,</i>

11:06.165 --> 11:08.376
<i>but what caught my attention the most was</i>

11:09.168 --> 11:13.172
<i>the rumor that Lady Loulan</i>
<i>might be pregnant too.</i>

11:13.255 --> 11:16.217
I can’t help but wonder…

11:16.300 --> 11:19.512
You know how she always wears
those extravagant outfits?

11:19.595 --> 11:22.890
But lately,
she’s been going out much less.

11:22.973 --> 11:27.144
And I heard she’s been wearing
looser clothing more often.

11:28.604 --> 11:31.023
<i>It’s been over six months</i>
<i>since Lady Loulan arrived.</i>

11:31.690 --> 11:35.361
<i>As the daughter of</i>
<i>the esteemed official Shishou,</i>

11:35.444 --> 11:37.988
<i>she was granted the rank of a high consort</i>
<i>with great fanfare.</i>

11:38.072 --> 11:40.032
<i>The Emperor couldn’t exactly ignore her.</i>

11:40.950 --> 11:42.076
<i>That would mean…</i>

11:42.159 --> 11:45.246
<i>out of the four high consorts,</i>
<i>three are now pregnant.</i>

11:45.329 --> 11:48.124
<i>It’s something to celebrate,</i>
<i>but at the same time, a bit ominous.</i>

11:48.999 --> 11:50.292
Hey.

11:50.376 --> 11:52.628
-Press a little harder on my legs.
-Yes!

11:54.046 --> 11:56.215
That feels amazing!

11:56.298 --> 11:58.050
When are you coming next?

11:58.843 --> 12:00.302
The day after tomorrow!

12:08.394 --> 12:09.770
<i>And then,</i>

12:09.854 --> 12:12.773
<i>there’s one more rumor</i>
<i>that keeps popping up here.</i>

12:14.692 --> 12:17.027
Oh, I wonder if he's there.

12:19.113 --> 12:21.657
I heard there’s a handsome new eunuch!

12:21.740 --> 12:23.909
I really want to see him.

12:23.993 --> 12:26.620
<i>This sounds strangely familiar.</i>

12:26.704 --> 12:29.957
I heard a rumor that 30 new eunuchs

12:30.040 --> 12:31.959
have joined recently.

12:32.042 --> 12:33.502
New eunuchs?

12:33.586 --> 12:36.297
But I thought they weren’t performing
the procedure anymore.

12:36.922 --> 12:38.048
They were slaves.

12:38.632 --> 12:41.760
Slaves? But I thought slavery had been
abolished in this country?

12:41.844 --> 12:44.054
They were likely foreign slaves.

12:44.138 --> 12:48.767
Some countries still castrate people
and turn them into slaves.

12:48.851 --> 12:52.104
Either they escaped, or they were rescued.

12:52.688 --> 12:54.648
If there were 30 of them, that means

12:54.732 --> 12:57.193
there must have been
a large-scale military operation.

12:57.276 --> 12:58.110
I see…

12:59.778 --> 13:03.240
<i>Shusui only ever seems</i>
<i>interested in insects,</i>

13:03.324 --> 13:04.783
<i>but she’s actually pretty smart.</i>

13:05.701 --> 13:07.411
The job of fetching bathwater

13:07.495 --> 13:09.872
usually falls to the new eunuchs, right?

13:09.955 --> 13:11.582
Is the rumored eunuch here?

13:11.665 --> 13:13.292
But he’s a eunuch, you know?

13:13.876 --> 13:15.753
But he’s good-looking, right?

13:15.836 --> 13:19.381
Well, probably not as handsome
as Lord Jinshi, though.

13:20.799 --> 13:22.551
What’s wrong, Maomao?

13:22.635 --> 13:23.802
Nothing…

13:23.886 --> 13:25.054
Now that you mention it,

13:25.137 --> 13:27.056
Maomao, you’re always with Lord Jinshi--

13:27.139 --> 13:28.974
I run errands for the consorts.

13:37.566 --> 13:38.692
Maomao?

13:38.776 --> 13:41.695
<i>Don’t think about it.</i>
<i>That was just a frog. Yes, a frog!</i>

13:44.990 --> 13:45.908
<i>Is that…?</i>

13:47.535 --> 13:49.787
<i>Why is Lady Lishu here?</i>

13:58.420 --> 14:01.006
<i>I feel like I'm being glared at.</i>

14:02.550 --> 14:06.345
You're on a break, aren't you?
Why not have some?

14:12.768 --> 14:14.228
I have a question.

14:15.604 --> 14:18.857
How did you come to serve
in the Jade Pavilion?

14:19.525 --> 14:20.818
Well, if you ask how…

14:21.527 --> 14:25.656
I became a poison taster
due to staff shortage at Jade Pavilion.

14:26.240 --> 14:29.285
I heard that already.
What I want to know is

14:29.368 --> 14:31.537
why the ever-suspicious

14:31.620 --> 14:34.415
Gyokuyou trusts you.

14:34.498 --> 14:35.499
Sister!

14:36.709 --> 14:39.753
<i>So she's close enough to call</i>
<i>Lady Gyokuyou by her name.</i>

14:39.837 --> 14:44.508
<i>In that case, it's natural to be</i>
<i>wary of a suspicious palace woman.</i>

14:44.592 --> 14:47.177
I'm just a poison taster.

14:47.261 --> 14:51.891
If someone tries to poison Lady Gyokuyou,
I'll be the first to die.

14:51.974 --> 14:55.853
If you see me as nothing more than that,
it should put your mind at ease.

14:57.229 --> 15:00.524
I’d heard about you, but you really are
straightforward, aren’t you?

15:01.025 --> 15:03.986
-Oh. Thank you.
-And…

15:04.570 --> 15:07.197
it seems you have quite a few friends
outside the palace.

15:07.281 --> 15:09.116
You might want to rein it in a little.

15:09.658 --> 15:11.285
If a senior palace woman spends

15:11.368 --> 15:14.246
all her time outside the rear palace,
the newer ones will start feeling lonely,

15:14.330 --> 15:15.623
don’t you think?

15:15.706 --> 15:18.834
Especially our youngest, Seki-u,

15:18.918 --> 15:20.377
she’s the same age as you.

15:22.504 --> 15:23.839
<i>That's true.</i>

15:23.923 --> 15:27.301
<i>Lately, I've been hanging out mostly</i>
<i>with Shisui and Xiaolan.</i>

15:27.384 --> 15:30.971
<i>Excessive wandering by a poison taster</i>
<i>can be suspicious.</i>

15:32.139 --> 15:35.309
In that case, why don’t we go
to the bathhouse together today?

15:37.269 --> 15:38.187
The bathhouse?

15:40.522 --> 15:42.066
Sounds like a good idea.

15:42.149 --> 15:45.986
Seki-u, it wouldn't hurt for you to
spend time with people outside our circle.

15:46.070 --> 15:47.655
But Sister Haku-u!

15:47.738 --> 15:51.450
You're going because Lady Gyokuyou
ordered it, right?

15:51.533 --> 15:52.368
That’s right.

15:52.451 --> 15:53.744
Sister Koku-u!

15:53.827 --> 15:56.580
Just think of it as part of your duty.

15:57.915 --> 15:59.083
What?!

16:02.127 --> 16:03.963
Oh, wow.

16:04.046 --> 16:06.632
So this is Maomao’s friend?

16:06.715 --> 16:09.218
My, my!

16:10.219 --> 16:12.388
Who are these people?

16:12.471 --> 16:14.181
They're harmless. Probably.

16:15.182 --> 16:17.393
Today shouldn’t be too bad.

16:17.476 --> 16:20.354
More girls have joined in
to do massages lately.

16:20.437 --> 16:21.355
Oh?

16:21.438 --> 16:25.401
Yeah. Some girls saw others getting combs
as gifts and got interested.

16:26.360 --> 16:30.155
<i>So the ones who were doing it before</i>
<i>were just good at keeping it under wraps.</i>

16:31.490 --> 16:33.742
Lady Seki-u, aren't you going to change?

16:33.826 --> 16:35.619
Of course I am!

16:36.120 --> 16:37.287
Huh?

16:37.371 --> 16:39.289
What is this?!

16:39.373 --> 16:42.292
No way!

16:44.753 --> 16:46.296
Um…

16:47.798 --> 16:49.633
Is this… all I’m supposed to wear?

16:49.717 --> 16:50.884
Yup.

16:50.968 --> 16:52.886
It’s hot inside anyway.

16:52.970 --> 16:55.347
No need to be shy!

16:57.433 --> 16:59.018
-Oh!
-Oh…

16:59.101 --> 17:00.602
You look just fine!

17:00.686 --> 17:02.563
What do you mean, "fine"?

17:02.646 --> 17:04.565
Modesty is more important!

17:07.526 --> 17:09.319
<i>Looks live we’ve got a defiant one.</i>

17:09.903 --> 17:13.157
If you're this embarrassed,
how have you managed until now?

17:13.741 --> 17:16.535
My sisters use this big bath, but…

17:17.119 --> 17:19.371
I asked Lady Gyokuyou

17:19.455 --> 17:21.623
if I could use the palace bath.

17:21.707 --> 17:25.544
In the western regions, we don’t bathe
as often because of the desert climate.

17:26.170 --> 17:29.298
Well, you'll get over the embarrassment
soon enough.

17:35.387 --> 17:38.932
The hair removal is done.
Please apply the scented oil, Lady Seki-u.

17:39.016 --> 17:40.559
Lady Seki-u, over here too!

17:40.642 --> 17:42.352
Yes!

17:44.438 --> 17:46.398
You can rub it on, right?

17:47.357 --> 17:48.400
Rub it on?

17:48.484 --> 17:51.862
Yes, slather it on
like you would with chicken.

17:52.571 --> 17:55.407
It’ll help them relax
and loosen their tongue.

17:56.366 --> 17:57.493
Got it.

18:02.039 --> 18:03.957
Alright, I will now begin the massage.

18:12.549 --> 18:13.383
<i>That’s…</i>

18:17.471 --> 18:18.388
<i>Lady Lishu?</i>

18:19.181 --> 18:21.016
<i>I saw her here last time too.</i>

18:21.517 --> 18:23.977
<i>If a consort comes to this bathhouse,</i>

18:24.061 --> 18:26.355
<i>won’t it make everyone uneasy?</i>

18:28.232 --> 18:30.651
Are you alright, Lady Lishu?

18:30.734 --> 18:32.903
Yes, Kanan.

18:33.612 --> 18:35.364
<i>Oh boy…</i>

18:35.864 --> 18:38.909
<i>I was thinking she should have</i>
<i>more capable maids,</i>

18:39.618 --> 18:43.038
<i>but then again, none of her maids</i>
<i>are particularly competent to begin with.</i>

18:43.872 --> 18:44.915
<i>Well, I guess</i>

18:44.998 --> 18:46.750
<i>it means she won’t intimidate anyone.</i>

18:47.876 --> 18:51.338
<i>Lady Lishu is only 15.</i>
<i>Though she holds a high rank,</i>

18:51.421 --> 18:53.757
<i>the Emperor doesn’t visit her chambers.</i>

18:53.841 --> 18:56.718
<i>She’s still just a timid young princess.</i>

18:57.886 --> 19:00.139
-Take my hand.
-Ah, thank you--

19:02.099 --> 19:05.644
<i>She's looking at me like</i>
<i>I’m some kind of monster again.</i>

19:05.727 --> 19:07.604
<i>I wish she’d get used to me already.</i>

19:09.314 --> 19:11.275
<i>A razor burn?</i>

19:11.358 --> 19:13.277
Um, Lady Lishu.

19:13.360 --> 19:14.862
Yes?

19:14.945 --> 19:17.990
Would you like to try
a new hair removal method?

19:20.075 --> 19:22.578
Um…

19:22.661 --> 19:24.496
Lady Lishu!

19:29.001 --> 19:31.128
Alright, please lie down here.

19:31.712 --> 19:33.297
Lady Lishu!

19:33.380 --> 19:35.299
What is a high-ranking consort doing here?

19:37.134 --> 19:38.302
Don’t worry.

19:40.387 --> 19:42.306
I’ll be gentle.

19:58.447 --> 19:59.615
You're all done.

20:00.490 --> 20:01.909
Thank you.

20:08.457 --> 20:10.125
All done.

20:10.709 --> 20:14.338
I’ve applied the scented oil as well,
so there shouldn’t be much irritation.

20:14.421 --> 20:15.839
I see.

20:15.923 --> 20:19.927
Is Lady Lishu
not used to this kind of thing?

20:20.010 --> 20:22.054
Well, not really.

20:22.638 --> 20:24.848
In the Diamond Pavilion, um…

20:24.932 --> 20:28.018
No one really cares about details.

20:28.101 --> 20:30.646
And before that, she was a nun.

20:31.855 --> 20:33.023
<i>Oh, right.</i>

20:34.775 --> 20:36.526
<i>Lady Lishu was married off</i>

20:36.610 --> 20:40.614
<i>to the previous Emperor as a</i>
<i>political pawn when she was just a child.</i>

20:41.406 --> 20:44.117
<i>After he passed, she became a nun,</i>

20:44.201 --> 20:47.704
<i>only to be reinstated as a consort</i>
<i>and brought back to the rear palace.</i>

20:48.997 --> 20:52.709
<i>Looking at it that way,</i>
<i>she’s had a rather unfortunate life.</i>

20:53.210 --> 20:57.631
<i>Maybe it’s a good thing her former</i>
<i>poison taster ended up as her head maid.</i>

20:58.590 --> 21:01.593
Since we’re at it… How about you?

21:02.261 --> 21:04.638
No thank you!

21:04.721 --> 21:06.139
Um…

21:07.432 --> 21:08.684
Thank you.

21:09.268 --> 21:10.727
If you’d like,

21:10.811 --> 21:12.688
I could offer you some chilled juice.

21:12.771 --> 21:14.314
Yay!

21:21.822 --> 21:23.073
Yum!

21:28.328 --> 21:32.958
By the way, Lady Lishu,
why did you come to the public bathhouse?

21:33.041 --> 21:35.836
The Diamond Pavilion
should have its own bath.

21:35.919 --> 21:37.087
Well…

21:44.177 --> 21:45.095
There’s…

21:51.643 --> 21:54.855
There’s a ghost…

21:59.943 --> 22:01.028
in that palace bathhouse!

22:08.994 --> 22:10.162
<i>A ghost?</i>

23:46.049 --> 23:50.053
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.519 --> 24:00.397
<i>The next episode is "The Dancing Ghost."</i>

24:00.480 --> 24:01.857
Subtitle translation by:
Abhishek Chand Ramola
